Package: ker
Version: 0.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3, python3-cryptography, gnupg, gpgv, openssl, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, xorriso, util-linux, keyutils, bpftool
Replaces: ker
Provides: ker-authorization
Maintainer: KER
Description: Linux media-backed kernel authorization system
 KER verifies signed removable media and optionally enforces
 kernel-level authorization. First run is terminal-only.
 This package does not auto-update. A newer package takes over
 existing keys, state, and policy and runs any needed migrations.
 Packages are architecture-specific because they ship a BPF object
 and ker-probe built for that architecture.
